B.a1U=new A.bX("rop_mcq_1","Which of the following is the appropriate Key Performance Indicator (KPI) for monitoring the quality of ROP prevention and management practices in an SNCU?",B.acj,1,"Percentage of eligible preterm/LBW babies receiving at least one ROP eye examination is the designated Key Performance Indicator (KPI) for monitoring the quality of ROP prevention and management practices in an SNCU.","ROP Prevention & KPIs",null,null)
B.aic=s(["Maintaining appropriate oxygen saturation and avoiding unnecessary oxygen exposure","Early and appropriate treatment of neonatal sepsis","Ensuring mother's own milk and appropriate weight gain","Liberal blood transfusion for anaemia"],t.s)
B.a1X=new A.bX("rop_mcq_2","All of the following measures are important for prevention of ROP EXCEPT:",B.aic,3,"Liberal blood transfusion for anaemia increases the risk of ROP. A restrictive transfusion policy, optimal oxygen saturation control, early sepsis treatment, and mother's own milk are key preventive strategies.","Prevention Measures",null,null)
B.ahw=s(["Referral of all infants to a tertiary eye hospital after discharge","On-site screening in SNCU/NICU by an ROP-trained ophthalmologist or tele-screening team with appropriate monitoring","Screening only when visual symptoms develop","Screening only for infants requiring oxygen therapy"],t.s)
B.a1P=new A.bX("rop_mcq_3","Which of the following is the preferred method for arranging ROP screening?",B.ahw,1,"On-site screening in SNCU/NICU by an ROP-trained ophthalmologist or tele-screening team with appropriate cardiorespiratory monitoring is the preferred method to prevent delays and missed cases.","Screening Arrangements",null,null)
